000010* FLUX CONSTRAINT ENGINE — COBOL
000020* INT8 SATURATED CONSTRAINT CHECKING FOR SAFETY-CRITICAL SYSTEMS
000030* BECAUSE BANKS DESERVE CONSTRAINTS TOO
000040*
000050 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000060 PROGRAM-ID. FLUX-CONSTRAINT.
000070*
000080 DATA DIVISION.
000090 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000100 01 INT8-MIN                  PIC S9(4) COMP VALUE -127.
000110 01 INT8-MAX                  PIC S9(4) COMP VALUE 127.
000120 01 WORK-VAL                  PIC S9(4) COMP.
000130 01 WORK-LO                   PIC S9(4) COMP.
000140 01 WORK-HI                   PIC S9(4) COMP.
000150 01 ERROR-MASK                PIC 9(4) COMP VALUE 0.
000160 01 VIOLATED-COUNT            PIC 9(4) COMP VALUE 0.
000170 01 IDX                       PIC 9(4) COMP.
000180*
000190 01 CONSTRAINT-TABLE.
000200    05 CONSTRAINT-ENTRY OCCURS 8 TIMES.
000210       10 C-LO                 PIC S9(4) COMP.
000220       10 C-HI                 PIC S9(4) COMP.
000230*
000240 01 CONSTRAINT-COUNT          PIC 9(4) COMP VALUE 0.
000250 01 INPUT-VALUE               PIC S9(4) COMP.
000260 01 RESULT-PASSED             PIC X VALUE "Y".
000270 01 RESULT-SEVERITY           PIC 9 VALUE 0.
000280*
000290 LINKAGE SECTION.
000300*
000310 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
000320 MAIN-SECTION.
000330*    SELF-TEST
000340     DISPLAY "FLUX CONSTRAINT ENGINE - COBOL"
000350     DISPLAY "=============================="
000360*
000370*    TEST 1: SATURATE
000380     CALL "SATURATE" USING -128, WORK-VAL
000390     IF WORK-VAL NOT = -127
000400         DISPLAY "FAIL: SATURATE(-128)" STOP RUN
000410     END-IF
000420     DISPLAY "  SATURATE: OK"
000430*
000440*    TEST 2: PASS
000450     MOVE 0 TO C-LO(1)
000460     MOVE 100 TO C-HI(1)
000470     MOVE 1 TO CONSTRAINT-COUNT
000480     MOVE 50 TO INPUT-VALUE
000490     PERFORM CHECK-VALUE
000500     IF RESULT-PASSED NOT = "Y"
000510         DISPLAY "FAIL: PASS" STOP RUN
000520     END-IF
000530     DISPLAY "  CHECK PASS: OK"
000540*
000550*    TEST 3: FAIL
000560     MOVE 150 TO INPUT-VALUE
000570     PERFORM CHECK-VALUE
000580     IF RESULT-PASSED = "Y"
000590         DISPLAY "FAIL: SHOULD FAIL" STOP RUN
000600     END-IF
000610     DISPLAY "  CHECK FAIL: OK"
000620*
000630     DISPLAY "  ALL TESTS PASS"
000640     STOP RUN.
000650*
000660 CHECK-VALUE.
000670     MOVE 0 TO ERROR-MASK
000680     MOVE 0 TO VIOLATED-COUNT
000690     MOVE "Y" TO RESULT-PASSED
000700*
000710     CALL "SATURATE" USING INPUT-VALUE, WORK-VAL
000720*
000730     PERFORM VARYING IDX FROM 1 BY 1
000740         UNTIL IDX > CONSTRAINT-COUNT
000750         CALL "SATURATE" USING C-LO(IDX), WORK-LO
000760         CALL "SATURATE" USING C-HI(IDX), WORK-HI
000770         IF WORK-VAL < WORK-LO OR WORK-VAL > WORK-HI
000780             ADD 1 TO VIOLATED-COUNT
000790             COMPUTE ERROR-MASK =
000800                 ERROR-MASK + (2 ** (IDX - 1))
000810             MOVE "N" TO RESULT-PASSED
000820         END-IF
000830     END-PERFORM.
000840*
000850 SATURATE SECTION.
000860     IF WORK-VAL < INT8-MIN
000870         MOVE INT8-MIN TO WORK-VAL
000880     ELSE IF WORK-VAL > INT8-MAX
000890         MOVE INT8-MAX TO WORK-VAL
000900     END-IF.
